{"type":"message","id":"e39ca1d4","parentId":"ff3d3827","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:24:04.296Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n现在脚本写好了，需要先安装依赖对吧？因为用到了playwright，所以先安装playwright和对应的浏览器。首先执行npm init -y，然后npm install playwright，然后npx playwright install chromium。对，先执行这些命令。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_p1pwgcng3524oqonnbuljfrw","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"npm init -y && npm install playwright && npx playwright install chromium","timeout":120}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773429842229}}
